<title>UK: London palladium fixed at fresh six-month high.</title>
<headline>London palladium fixed at fresh six-month high.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palladium was fixed on Friday at $130.50 per ounce, its highest level since August 2 last year.</p>
<p>On Thursday it achieved its highest fixing since August 13, 1996 at $129.00</p>
<p>The new high continued a rise fuelled by consumer and speculator buying of the metal in a market tightened by delays in Russian-Japanese 1997 supply talks, traders said.</p>
